---
description: Binding agent contract for Links — commits, verify scripts, safe deletes
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENT.md` in the repo root on every turn.

- After each sub-feature, `git commit` (why in 1–2 sentences). Never commit `data/config.json` or `received/`.
- After functional changes, run `scripts/verify.ps1`. Do not tell the user it is done until it exits 0.
- Never delete paths outside `H:\links`. Resolve the path first; skip the delete if it is not inside the repo or not an expected target.
